        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "compose",
      "seconds": 18,
      "heading": "Three steps, composed",
      "narration": "Now we put the three together. Triple the values. Keep the ones greater than five. Add them up. The answer is sixty, the same as the loop. Each step is one whole array operation, and each one has a name.",
      "lines": [],
      "panel": {
        "type": "code",
        "lines": [
          {
            "xtl": "values := 2 4 6 8"
          },
          {
            "xtl": "tripled := 3 * values"
          },
          {
            "xtl": "big := (tripled > 5) r_eplicate tripled"
          },
          {
            "xtl": "'+ r_/ big"
